            <div xml:id="d94">

                <pb facs="0231" n="127" sameAs="frus:frus1933v02/pg127"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Executive Agreement Series No. 54</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister of External Affairs of the Union of South
                        Africa (Hertzog) to the American Minister in the Union of South Africa
                        (Totten)</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Pretoria</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1933-09-20">20 September,
                        1933</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honour to refer to your letter
                    No. 166 of the 17th March last regarding the arrangement between the Union of
                    South Africa and the United States of America providing for navigation by
                    aircraft of each country in the territory of the other and to inform you <pb
                        facs="0232" n="128" xml:id="pg128"/> that His Majesty’s Government in the
                    Union of South Africa are in accord with the terms of the arrangement which is,
                    word for word as follows:— <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>[Here follows text of the arrangement as given in note No. 166, March 17,
                            printed <hi rendition="#italic">supra</hi>.]</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <p>It is further agreed that the arrangement will be operative as from the date of
                    this note.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">J. B. M. Hertzog</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
